The tests of slimcc (https://github.com/fuhsnn/slimcc, MIT; see LICENSE),
from commit 2388c39989886fee05df045b6a669d684aee3946, unchanged: test/*.c,
test/*.h, the files test/embed.c embeds, and test/host/common.c, which
slimcc's test driver compiles with the host's C compiler and links with
every test. slimcc extends chibicc (also MIT, Rui Ueyama), whose tests
these began as.

TestSlimcc (../../slimcc_test.go) runs them; status.txt lists the ones
cmd/cc passes.
